---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <h1>Look after the body you <em>actually</em> live in.</h1>
      <p class="lead">{{ site.description }}</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-ink" href="/articles/">Read the latest</a>
        <a class="btn btn-glass" href="/about/">How we choose what to publish</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-note">
        <div><strong>2 posts</strong>every week</div>
        <div><strong>0</strong>sponsored products</div>
        <div><strong>5 min</strong>average read</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stage" id="stage">
      <div class="scene" id="scene">
        <div class="ring"><span></span></div>
        <div class="orb orb-a"></div>
        <div class="orb orb-b"></div>

        {% for post in collections.posts | limit(3) %}
        {% set t = "rose" if post.data.pillar == "beauty" else ("gold" if post.data.category == "Nutrition" else "fern") %}
        <a class="slab slab-{{ loop.index }}" href="{{ post.url }}">
          <span class="tag tag-{{ t }}">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
          <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}

        <span class="chip chip-1">Evidence-based</span>
        <span class="chip chip-2">New every week</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="latest">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Latest articles</h2>
      <a class="btn btn-glass" href="/articles/">All articles</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid" id="grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts | limit(6) %}{% include "card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:20px">
  <div class="wrap pillars">
    <a class="pillar pillar-beauty tilt" href="/beauty/">
      <div class="float"></div>
      <h2>Beauty</h2>
      <p>Skin and hair respond to a small number of things done consistently. We cover those first.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Skincare routines that scale from three steps to seven</li>
        <li>Ingredients: what the research says, in plain words</li>
        <li>Hair health, washing and heat</li>
        <li>Acne, pigmentation and sensitivity without the panic</li>
      </ul>
    </a>
    <a class="pillar pillar-fitness tilt" href="/fitness/">
      <div class="float"></div>
      <h2>Fitness</h2>
      <p>Strength, mobility and enough cardio to keep your heart happy — programmed for real schedules.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Beginner and intermediate strength programmes</li>
        <li>Mobility routines for desk-bound bodies</li>
        <li>Nutrition for training, without counting everything</li>
        <li>Recovery, sleep and managing niggles</li>
      </ul>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="method">
  <div class="wrap method">
    <div>
      <h2>How we decide what to publish</h2>
      <p>Beauty and fitness are full of confident advice and thin evidence. Every article here starts with the question "what does the best available research actually show?" — and says so plainly when the answer is "not much yet".</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rules">
      <div class="rule"><span class="dot"></span><div><strong>Sources over opinions</strong><span>Claims link to reviews and trials, not to influencers or brand pages.</span></div></div>
      <div class="rule"><span class="dot"></span><div><strong>No sponsored recommendations</strong><span>If we name a product, nobody paid us to. We'd rather name an ingredient.</span></div></div>
      <div class="rule"><span class="dot"></span><div><strong>Written to be used</strong><span>Every post ends with what to do this week, not a list of things to worry about.</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="signup">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="signup">
      <div>
        <h2>One letter a week. Two articles. Nothing else.</h2>
        <p>Sent every Sunday morning. Unsubscribe in one click whenever you like.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <form id="form">
          <input type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" aria-label="Email address">
          <button class="btn btn-rose" type="submit">Subscribe</button>
        </form>
        <p class="ok" id="ok">Subscribed. Your first letter arrives Sunday.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
